---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Case Study: One Aesthetics — Healthcare Clinic Website | GeekBytes"
  description="How GeekBytes built a conversion-focused website for One Aesthetics, a Canadian medical aesthetics clinic, replacing phone-only bookings with an automated online consultation flow."
>
  <main class="bg-brand-black text-brand-white min-h-screen">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <a href="/#projects" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-accent text-sm mb-8 hover:underline">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"/></svg>
          Back to Portfolio
        </a>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-5">
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-accent/50 text-brand-accent">Healthcare</span>
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-gray-400">WordPress</span>
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-gray-400">Booking System</span>
          <span class="text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/20 text-gray-400">Canada</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">One Aesthetics</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          A medical aesthetics clinic that replaced manual phone-only bookings with an automated online consultation system — and saw immediate results.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-8">
          <a
            href="https://oneaesthetics.ca/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-accent text-white font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm hover:bg-brand-accent/90 transition-colors"
          >
            Visit Live Site
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V8a2 2 0 012-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stats bar -->
    <section class="border-y border-white/10 py-10 px-4">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-accent">24/7</p>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">online booking — no more missed calls after hours</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-accent">8</p>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">treatment landing pages with individual SEO targeting</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-accent">5 wks</p>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">from discovery to launch</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Body -->
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 space-y-14">

      <!-- Challenge -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The Challenge</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          One Aesthetics is a Canadian medical aesthetics clinic offering treatments from Botox and fillers to laser skin resurfacing. Their original site was a single-page brochure with no booking capability — all appointments were handled by phone during business hours only.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          The clinic was losing after-hours enquiries and had no way for prospective patients to research specific treatments before committing to a consultation call. The team needed a site that educated visitors, built trust through results imagery, and converted that interest into booked appointments — automatically.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- What we built -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What We Built</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 border border-brand-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-brand-white font-semibold">Treatment-Specific Landing Pages</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Individual pages for each treatment (Botox, lip fillers, laser, PRP, etc.) with procedure details, expected outcomes, pricing ranges, and FAQs — giving prospective patients enough information to self-qualify before booking.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 border border-brand-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-brand-white font-semibold">Online Consultation Booking Flow</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">A multi-step booking form integrated with the clinic's calendar — patients select a treatment, pick a time slot, and receive a confirmation email automatically. Appointment reminders are sent 24 hours before the visit.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 border border-brand-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-brand-white font-semibold">Before & After Gallery</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">A protected, tasteful results gallery organized by treatment type, with patient consent management built in. The gallery significantly increased time-on-site and became the most visited section after the homepage.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4">
            <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/10 border border-brand-accent/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">4</span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-brand-white font-semibold">Trust & Credentials Section</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">Prominently featured practitioner credentials, regulatory registrations, and client testimonials — critical for medical aesthetics where trust is the primary conversion factor for new patients.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Tech stack -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Tech Stack</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          {["WordPress", "Elementor Pro", "Bookly (Booking Plugin)", "WooCommerce Deposits", "Yoast SEO", "Mailchimp Integration"].map(tech => (
            <span class="text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-white/15 text-gray-300">{tech}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Results -->
      <section class="bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Results</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
          Within weeks of launch, the clinic was receiving appointment bookings outside of business hours — something that had previously been impossible. The detailed treatment pages reduced the volume of basic enquiry calls, freeing the team to focus on higher-value consultations.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mt-4">
          The before/after gallery became the highest-traffic section of the site after the homepage, and individual treatment pages began ranking in local search results for queries like "Botox [city]" and "lip fillers near me."
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section class="text-center pt-4">
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">Running a clinic or healthcare practice? We specialize in medical website builds.</p>
        <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-accent text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-brand-accent/90 transition-colors">
          Get a Free Consultation
        </a>
      </section>

    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
